+# vcs-files.yazi
+
+Show Git file changes in Yazi.
+
+https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/465b801b-3516-4f57-be09-8405da21e34d
+
+## Installation
+
+```sh
+ya pkg add yazi-rs/plugins:vcs-files
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+```toml
+# keymap.toml
+[[mgr.prepend_keymap]]
+on   = [ "g", "c" ]
+run  = "plugin vcs-files"
+desc = "Show Git file changes"
+```
+
+Note that, the keybindings above are just examples, please tune them up as needed to ensure they don't conflict with your other actions/plugins.
+
+## TODO
+
+- [ ] Add support for other VCS (e.g. Mercurial, Subversion)
+
+## License
+
+This plugin is MIT-licensed. For more information check the [LICENSE](LICENSE) file.
